1081+ 0A99              ; Guest RAM backing access
1082+ 0A99              ;
1083+ 0A99              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
1084+ 0A99              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
